1
00:00:35,570 --> 00:00:36,930
Hand over the money!

2
00:00:37,050 --> 00:00:37,850
Hand it over!

3
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:42,320
Such a nice watch.

4
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:43,500
He must have money.

5
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:46,970
Hand over the money!

6
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:52,040
Hurry up and hand over the money!

7
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:54,460
Playing dead, huh?

8
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,930
I'll let you play dead all you want!

9
00:01:00,120 --> 00:01:01,120
Who are you?

10
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:03,920
Bro, let's talk this out.

11
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:06,920
Trying to be a hero?

12
00:01:06,920 --> 00:01:07,560
Fine.

13
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:09,220
I'll beat you up too.

14
00:01:10,280 --> 00:01:10,920
Come at me.

15
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:15,560
Boss, are you okay?

16
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:18,340
Good thing I was prepared.

17
00:01:20,539 --> 00:01:21,920
What are you waiting for?

18
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:22,480
Let's go.

19
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:40,350
[Nancang Lane]

20
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:42,120
You take the path on the right later.

21
00:01:41,060 --> 00:01:44,150
[Lu Ye, Young Chief of the Qingtian Gang]

22
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:43,120
Okay.

23
00:01:44,520 --> 00:01:46,710
That voice is...

24
00:01:50,240 --> 00:01:51,360
Shen Tianbai?

25
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:54,880
[Shen Tianbai, Sheriff of Ningcheng]

26
00:01:54,910 --> 00:01:55,970
Chief Lu,

27
00:01:55,990 --> 00:01:56,960
I'm sorry.

28
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:12,480
Lu Wenbiao trafficked in drugs.

29
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:16,040
Sheriff Shen Tianbai
killed him with one shot.

30
00:02:23,810 --> 00:02:25,410
You killed my father,

31
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:28,300
and you still have the nerve
to show up in front of me?

32
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:32,610
Who...

33
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:34,190
are you?

34
00:02:38,290 --> 00:02:40,720
[Eclipse in the Lost City] [Episode 1]

35
00:02:40,570 --> 00:02:41,760
Newspaper! Newspaper!

36
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:43,120
Take a look!

37
00:02:42,670 --> 00:02:46,650
[Half a day ago]

38
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:44,680
The latest Ningcheng Daily!

39
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:48,120
Lu Wenbiao, Chief of the Qingtian Gang,
dealt in drugs and remained unrepentant!

40
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:50,360
Sheriff Shen Tianbai
killed him with one shot!

41
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:52,160
The Qingtian Gang is falling apart,

42
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:54,360
and each branch is setting up
its own faction!

43
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,690
The Shisha Gang is rising!

44
00:02:55,690 --> 00:02:57,600
Ningcheng's underworld
is undergoing a major reshuffle!

45
00:02:57,600 --> 00:02:58,300
The strange thing is,

46
00:02:58,300 --> 00:02:59,620
after making such a great contribution,

47
00:02:59,620 --> 00:03:02,650
our great hero Shen Tianbai
has mysteriously disappeared!

48
00:03:02,650 --> 00:03:03,930
How could that be?

49
00:03:06,100 --> 00:03:08,000
Lu Wenbiao has a son

50
00:03:08,020 --> 00:03:09,260
named Lu Ye.

51
00:03:09,260 --> 00:03:09,940
Where is he?

52
00:03:10,820 --> 00:03:11,680
Good question.

53
00:03:11,900 --> 00:03:14,630
This Lu Ye is the number one playboy
in Ningcheng.

54
00:03:15,870 --> 00:03:18,160
It's said he just came back
from studying abroad.

55
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:19,340
Now that the Qingtian Gang has fallen,

56
00:03:19,340 --> 00:03:22,800
this young master of the Lu family
can only wander the streets.

57
00:03:23,460 --> 00:03:24,140
However,

58
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:25,700
I heard that

59
00:03:26,060 --> 00:03:28,940
this young master,
relying on his pretty face,

60
00:03:28,970 --> 00:03:31,070
has already become a top gigolo!

61
00:03:32,660 --> 00:03:33,460
Listen, everyone.

62
00:03:33,460 --> 00:03:34,980
Let me ask around some more.

63
00:03:34,980 --> 00:03:36,100
When I find Lu Ye,

64
00:03:36,220 --> 00:03:37,220
I'll tell you all.

65
00:03:40,970 --> 00:03:42,100
You wanted to see me?

66
00:03:44,340 --> 00:03:45,140
Kid.

67
00:03:46,310 --> 00:03:47,240
What do you want?

68
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:49,740
You've been badmouthing me everywhere.

69
00:03:50,160 --> 00:03:52,360
Then don't blame me for being ruthless.

70
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:53,760
Help!

71
00:03:53,780 --> 00:03:54,700
Help!

72
00:03:56,420 --> 00:03:57,100
Help!

73
00:04:04,650 --> 00:04:05,250
Help!

74
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:06,120
Help...

75
00:04:11,230 --> 00:04:15,370
[Dashijie]

76
00:04:18,130 --> 00:04:18,649
Done.

77
00:04:18,670 --> 00:04:19,300
Thank you.

78
00:04:19,300 --> 00:04:20,860
You shined my shoes
pretty well, Young Master.

79
00:04:20,860 --> 00:04:21,940
Everyone, everyone,

80
00:04:21,940 --> 00:04:23,820
the bankrupt heir is back
in the workforce.

81
00:04:23,820 --> 00:04:25,020
For only 5 coins,

82
00:04:25,370 --> 00:04:28,500
you can have the Young Master
of the Qingtian Gang shine your shoes.

83
00:04:28,500 --> 00:04:30,740
Don't miss out as you pass by!

84
00:04:30,740 --> 00:04:31,780
Come, let me try.

85
00:04:31,780 --> 00:04:33,020
Come get your shoes shined!

86
00:04:33,020 --> 00:04:33,500
Okay.

87
00:04:33,520 --> 00:04:33,909
Here.

88
00:04:39,780 --> 00:04:40,740
Young Master,

89
00:04:41,340 --> 00:04:42,270
long time no see.

90
00:04:48,020 --> 00:04:49,020
Young Master,

91
00:04:49,580 --> 00:04:50,540
shine them.

92
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:53,480
No problem.

93
00:04:53,620 --> 00:04:55,020
It'll be done right away.

94
00:04:55,900 --> 00:04:57,180
Who is this?

95
00:04:57,610 --> 00:04:59,490
The Qingtian Gang has 4 branches,

96
00:04:59,510 --> 00:05:01,900
namely Qinglong in the east,
Baihu in the west,

97
00:05:01,900 --> 00:05:04,090
Zhuque in the south,
and Xuanwu in the north.

98
00:05:04,090 --> 00:05:06,130
This man is named Biao.

99
00:05:06,290 --> 00:05:08,090
He is a subordinate of Qinglong.

100
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:13,640
I heard that when he deducted
the dock workers' wages before,

101
00:05:13,710 --> 00:05:14,620
he was discovered by Lu Ye

102
00:05:14,620 --> 00:05:16,050
and was almost beaten to death.

103
00:05:16,050 --> 00:05:18,650
When I grovelled on my knees,

104
00:05:18,910 --> 00:05:20,630
begging you again and again,

105
00:05:20,660 --> 00:05:23,060
I never thought this day would come.

106
00:05:23,870 --> 00:05:25,550
The tables have turned.

107
00:05:25,900 --> 00:05:27,980
It's time for you to taste

108
00:05:28,010 --> 00:05:30,290
what it's like to be trampled underfoot.

109
00:05:30,650 --> 00:05:31,410
However,

110
00:05:31,430 --> 00:05:33,290
Young Master, you're in trouble.

111
00:05:33,390 --> 00:05:36,110
I value loyalty and righteousness,

112
00:05:36,570 --> 00:05:38,030
so I still have to help you.

113
00:05:44,110 --> 00:05:45,110
Good job.

114
00:05:46,500 --> 00:05:47,630
This is your reward.

115
00:05:49,260 --> 00:05:50,140
Why?

116
00:05:50,570 --> 00:05:51,570
You don't want it?

117
00:05:52,490 --> 00:05:54,010
I do.

118
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:55,080
Thank you, Sir.

119
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:01,560
Let's go.

120
00:06:09,740 --> 00:06:10,700
Idiot.

121
00:06:23,340 --> 00:06:24,140
Dad.

122
00:06:24,890 --> 00:06:27,060
You hated drugs the most
when you were alive.

123
00:06:27,060 --> 00:06:28,700
How could you traffic in drugs?

124
00:06:28,700 --> 00:06:31,060
There must be something wrong.

125
00:06:36,750 --> 00:06:38,510
Shen Tianbai.

126
00:06:39,860 --> 00:06:41,620
Young Master. Young Master,

127
00:06:41,830 --> 00:06:43,210
the police station just issued
an announcement,

128
00:06:43,210 --> 00:06:44,210
saying

129
00:06:43,530 --> 00:06:46,460
[Uncle Zhong, Xuanwu Branch
of the Qingtian Gang]

130
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:47,020
that they still
haven't found Shen Tianbai.

131
00:06:48,790 --> 00:06:49,950
He killed my dad.

132
00:06:50,180 --> 00:06:51,500
Even if he were to hide
in the underworld of the dead,

133
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:52,100
I would definitely

134
00:06:52,100 --> 00:06:53,420
drag him out

135
00:06:53,940 --> 00:06:55,140
and take revenge.

136
00:06:55,659 --> 00:07:00,940
[Spirit Tablet of Lu Wenbiao]

137
00:06:57,830 --> 00:06:59,230
Dad, you left so peacefully,

138
00:06:59,230 --> 00:07:01,450
even preparing
a spirit tablet for yourself.

139
00:07:01,450 --> 00:07:02,380
But don't worry.

140
00:07:03,030 --> 00:07:06,290
I will reclaim everything
belonging to the Qingtian Gang,

141
00:07:06,500 --> 00:07:08,180
just as it once was.

142
00:07:08,990 --> 00:07:09,910
Young Master,

143
00:07:09,930 --> 00:07:13,330
the most important thing right now
is the goods from Xingang.

144
00:07:18,690 --> 00:07:20,090
Qinglong, that jerk,

145
00:07:20,110 --> 00:07:21,670
couldn't wait to go solo

146
00:07:21,700 --> 00:07:23,280
when the old chief just died.

147
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:25,740
He must have sent
someone to rob those goods.

148
00:07:25,990 --> 00:07:26,780
If it weren't for him,

149
00:07:26,780 --> 00:07:27,700
how could that jerk Biao

150
00:07:27,700 --> 00:07:28,420
dare to push his luck?

151
00:07:28,420 --> 00:07:29,280
Don't say that.

152
00:07:30,230 --> 00:07:31,910
He did us a huge favor.

153
00:07:32,980 --> 00:07:33,710
A huge favor?

154
00:07:34,150 --> 00:07:37,430
The goods from Xingang
are hidden in Nancang Lane.

155
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:39,200
Young Master, how...

156
00:07:39,220 --> 00:07:40,300
how did you know?

157
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,840
Of course, he told me.

158
00:07:46,630 --> 00:07:48,750
The tables have turned.

159
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:53,090
Camphor tree's leaves.

160
00:07:53,530 --> 00:07:54,730
In this season,

161
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:57,180
only Nancang Lane has camphor trees.

162
00:07:59,500 --> 00:08:00,170
Young Master,

163
00:08:00,170 --> 00:08:01,730
in front of Dashijie,

164
00:08:01,750 --> 00:08:03,300
did you shine people's shoes on purpose?

165
00:08:03,300 --> 00:08:04,850
Biao has a grudge against me.

166
00:08:04,850 --> 00:08:08,060
He knew I was in trouble and would
definitely kick me when I'm down.

167
00:08:08,060 --> 00:08:09,590
I know Qinglong trusts him.

168
00:08:09,860 --> 00:08:12,460
I just wanted to try my luck
and find some clues.

169
00:08:12,540 --> 00:08:14,860
I didn't expect such a big surprise.

170
00:08:15,870 --> 00:08:17,130
Since that's the case,

171
00:08:17,280 --> 00:08:19,640
I'll just have to accept this great gift.

172
00:08:21,330 --> 00:08:23,730
I'll go to Nancang Lane
tonight to confirm.

173
00:08:23,890 --> 00:08:25,780
Wait for my news before taking action.

174
00:08:25,780 --> 00:08:26,580
Yes.

175
00:08:29,170 --> 00:08:30,780
[Nancang Lane]

176
00:08:32,870 --> 00:08:36,070
The goods are indeed here.

177
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:38,030
Qinglong,

178
00:08:38,250 --> 00:08:39,929
you're being too brazen.

179
00:08:40,630 --> 00:08:41,630
It seems...

180
00:08:41,940 --> 00:08:43,070
Hand over the money!

181
00:08:46,610 --> 00:08:47,810
Hand over the money!

182
00:08:51,310 --> 00:08:52,190
Hand it over!

183
00:08:52,260 --> 00:08:55,170
Stay out of other people's troubles
to keep your livelihood safe.

184
00:08:55,170 --> 00:08:56,130
Wait.

185
00:08:56,760 --> 00:08:57,860
If he dies here

186
00:08:57,890 --> 00:08:59,090
and draws the police,

187
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:00,640
what about my goods?

188
00:09:04,030 --> 00:09:04,830
Stop!

189
00:09:12,650 --> 00:09:14,210
How could you have amnesia?

190
00:09:14,630 --> 00:09:15,590
You know me?

191
00:09:15,830 --> 00:09:17,910
I'd know you even if you turned to ashes.

192
00:09:17,910 --> 00:09:18,710
Who am I?

193
00:09:27,900 --> 00:09:30,590
You are my lapdog.

194
00:09:35,620 --> 00:09:37,080
Your name is Shen Tianbai.

195
00:09:37,710 --> 00:09:40,110
You're the youngest sheriff in Ningcheng.

196
00:09:42,660 --> 00:09:43,260
Right.

197
00:09:44,020 --> 00:09:45,020
More than that,

198
00:09:45,510 --> 00:09:47,710
you're also the savior in their hearts!

199
00:09:51,410 --> 00:09:52,370
Of course.

200
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,300
Most importantly,

201
00:09:55,970 --> 00:09:59,930
you are the one who killed my father.

202
00:10:00,050 --> 00:10:01,740
[The Qingtian Gang Falls:
Shen Tianbai, the People's Savior]

203
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:19,760
Faking amnesia?

204
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:36,240
Do you remember now,

205
00:10:36,340 --> 00:10:37,500
Officer Shen?

206
00:10:39,300 --> 00:10:41,230
I really don't remember anything.

207
00:10:42,770 --> 00:10:43,830
It doesn't matter.

208
00:10:46,810 --> 00:10:48,140
Just pay with your life.

209
00:11:07,820 --> 00:11:08,820
You're lucky.

210
00:11:10,300 --> 00:11:11,500
As long as you want it,

211
00:11:11,980 --> 00:11:14,940
my life is yours anytime.

212
00:11:17,060 --> 00:11:18,020
So,

213
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:21,600
can you take me in now?

214
00:11:25,700 --> 00:11:27,760
Then what are you willing to do for me?

215
00:11:27,940 --> 00:11:28,820
Anything.

216
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:31,720
Come here.

217
00:11:33,780 --> 00:11:34,580
Come here.

218
00:12:07,180 --> 00:12:08,580
If you want to be a lapdog,

219
00:12:09,340 --> 00:12:11,140
you must be a good, obedient one.

220
00:12:15,900 --> 00:12:16,900
Only good lapdogs

221
00:12:19,550 --> 00:12:20,750
get bones.

222
00:12:24,330 --> 00:12:25,390
Do you understand?

223
00:12:26,980 --> 00:12:28,100
Understood,

224
00:12:28,610 --> 00:12:29,410
Young Master.

225
00:12:48,740 --> 00:12:49,780
Lu Ye.

226
00:12:51,870 --> 00:12:53,790
You're still

227
00:12:55,470 --> 00:12:57,830
as soft-hearted as before.
